      "text": "Use | a/an | the | zero article\nCore | 一个/某个，首次非特指 | 那个/这些人都知道的、已特指 | 泛指复数/不可数、部分固定结构\nExamples | a student, an hour | the student we met, the sun | Students need sleep. / go to school",
      "sourcePage": 111,
      "sourceIndex": 2881
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· a/an 看发音：an hour, a university。",
      "sourcePage": 111,
      "sourceIndex": 2882
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 最高级、序数词、same/only 前常见 the。",
      "sourcePage": 111,
      "sourceIndex": 2883
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 第一次 a/an，第二次再次指同一个通常 the。",
      "sourcePage": 111,
      "sourceIndex": 2884
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 固定搭配必须整块记，不要机械套“特指”。",
      "sourcePage": 111,
      "sourceIndex": 2885
    }
